PIN LAYOUT OF ESP32 WROOM (http://wiki.fluidnc.com/en/hardware/esp32_pin_reference):

    -> pulse_cnt (https://blog.eletrogate.com/esp32-frequencimetro-de-precisao/):
            - pin 32 and 35 should be connected to each other
            - pin 34 should be connected to frequency generator

    -> sine_gen (https://www.techrm.com/guide-to-creating-a-simple-signal-generator-with-esp32/):
            - pin 25: triangle wave
            - pin 26: block wave or sine wave

    -> UART connection:
            - pin 17: transmit UART
            - pin 16: receive UART

    -> input control:
            - pin 5: calibration_button
            - pin 4: potentiometer

    non usable pins: 0, 1, 3, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, 11